%% Identity Resolution Sequence — anonymous-to-known transition
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Visitor (Anonymous)
    participant DL as Client-side Data Layer
    participant CDP as CDP Platform
    participant ID as Identity Service
    participant P as Unified Profile

    U->>DL: Browses site (anonymous device ID assigned)
    DL->>CDP: Sends events tagged with device ID namespace
    CDP->>ID: Registers device ID
    U->>DL: Logs in (known ID captured)
    DL->>CDP: Sends login event with device ID + known ID
    CDP->>ID: Links device ID to known ID
    ID->>P: Merge profiles per merge policy
    P-->>CDP: Unified profile now includes pre-login history\n(per retroactive-attribution policy)
